---
title: LCS vs PPAC Comparison
---
flowchart LR
    subgraph "LCS (Legacy)"
        direction TB
        L_BUILD[Build VM optional<br/>~$500/mo if used]
        L_HOSTED[Hosted agents also<br/>supported via NuGet]
        L_UPLOAD[Upload to<br/>Asset Library]
        L_PORTAL[Manual apply to prod<br/>or limited API]
        L_WAIT[Wait...<br/>Limited status API]
        L_PROV[New envs: limited API<br/>Tier 2+ requires SKU purchase]

        L_BUILD --> L_UPLOAD
        L_HOSTED --> L_UPLOAD
        L_UPLOAD --> L_PORTAL
        L_PORTAL --> L_WAIT
    end

    subgraph "PPAC (This Repo)"
        direction TB
        P_BUILD[Hosted Agent<br/>Monthly parallel job]
        P_ART[Pipeline Artifact<br/>Immutable]
        P_DEPLOY[API Deploy<br/>PowerPlatformDeployPackage]
        P_VERIFY[PPAC Management API<br/>Full status polling]
        P_PROV[Branch push<br/>= sandbox in ~5-6 hours<br/>Automated cleanup on branch delete]

        P_BUILD --> P_ART
        P_ART --> P_DEPLOY
        P_DEPLOY --> P_VERIFY
    end

